---
// Return page of the T-Kassa (Tinkoff) payment form: FailURL in Init.
// The form opens inside the app's WebView, and the app closes it as soon as it
// sees this path, so the page is only ever read by someone who paid from a
// browser. Deliberately not localized (RU-only payments, utility page, noindex,
// excluded from the sitemap in astro.config.mjs).
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>Lingo7</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        background: #1a2332;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      }
      main {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 26rem;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .logo {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      .card {
        padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
        background: #2a3649;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border-radius: 12px;
      }
      .mark {
        width: 3rem;
        height: 3rem;
        margin: 0 auto 1rem;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #f97316;
        color: #2b1206;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 3rem;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      p a {
        color: #4ade80;
      }
      .site-link {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="logo">Lingo7</div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="mark">!</div>
        <h1>Оплата не прошла</h1>
        <p>
          Деньги не списаны. Вернитесь в приложение и попробуйте ещё раз или выберите другой способ
          оплаты. Если проблема повторяется, напишите нам:
          <a href="mailto:support@lingoseven.com">support@lingoseven.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="site-link" href="https://lingoseven.com">lingoseven.com</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
